                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, throwing spear and javelins if formed, javelins only if skirmishing, and buckler. Open Order or Skirmishers. Feigned Flight. Availability: Lancaster and Tudor. (Armies of Chivalry p.63)</characteristic>
